DESCRIPTION:Venue: Studio Galande\, 42 rue Galande\, 75005 Paris\nReady for
  a movie night like no other? Join ESN Paris for a unique cinematic experi
 ence at the legendary Rocky Horror Picture Show at Studio Galande\, right 
