 to the cinema. This is not just a movie screening\, it's a cult classic br
 ought to life! ✨ Follow Brad and Janet\, a young couple whose car breaks
  down during a storm\, as they stumble upon a mysterious castle filled wit
 h eccentric characters\, bizarre experiments\, and unexpected adventures. 
 The movie is in VOST (english with subtitles). WHAT MAKES IT SPECIAL Get r
 eady for an interactive experience where the audience becomes part of the 
 show! Sing along\, dance to the iconic Time Warp\, and enjoy live performa
 nces by a cast of enthusiastic actors recreating scenes right in front of 
 the screen. WHY JOIN US Discover one of Paris's most iconic cinema experie
 nces. Meet fellow international students and make new friends. Immerse you
 rself in the film's wild\, eccentric\, and unforgettable atmosphere. Enjoy
  a unique night out with the Erasmus community! Pro tip: Come ready to sin
 g\, dance\, and embrace the madness! You can even bring rice and water to 
 participate in the t...\n\nhttps://www.billetweb.fr/rocky-horror-picture-s
 how-movie-and-live-show
