SUMMARY:Movie Night: Minotaure
LOCATION:Le Saint-Germain-des-Prés 22 rue Guillaume-Apollinaire Paris\, 75
 006
URL:https://www.billetweb.fr/movie-night-minotaure
DESCRIPTION:Venue: Le Saint-Germain-des-Prés 22 rue Guillaume-Apollinaire 
 Paris\, 75006\nMovie Night: Minotaure ✨ Ready for a special Russian cine
 ma night in the heart of Saint-Germain-des-Prés? Join us on Tuesday\, Nov
 ember 10th for a screening of Minotaure\, in Russian with English subtitle
 s. The evening will begin with drinks at 7 PM\, followed by the screening 
 at 8 PM at Cinéma Le Saint-Germain-des-Prés. The screening will be intro
 duced by Joël Chapron\, an expert in Russian cinema and the cinemas of Ce
 ntral and Eastern Europe\, and a close friend of director Andrey Zvyagints
 ev since the beginning of his career. Minotaure is a 2026 Russian-language
  political thriller drama directed and edited by Andrey Zvyagintsev\, co-w
 ritten with Simon Liashenko and inspired by Claude Chabrol’s 1969 film T
 he Unfaithful Wife. Critically acclaimed and selected as France’s entry 
 for Best International Feature Film at the 99th Academy Awards\, the film 
 promises a powerful and thought-provoking cinematic experience. No worries
  if you don’t speak Russian: the film comes with English subtitles\,so e
 veryone can enjoy it! Spots available: 20 - book quickly\, places are very
  limited!\n\nhttps://www.billetweb.fr/movie-night-minotaure
END:VEVENT
