SUMMARY:Visit Musée de Cluny
LOCATION:28 Rue Rue du Sommerard (75005 PARIS)
URL:https://www.billetweb.fr/visit-musee-de-cluny
DESCRIPTION:Venue: 28 Rue Rue du Sommerard (75005 PARIS)\nVisit Musée de C
 luny and discover the world's most iconic alchemist with ESN Paris! Join u
 s for a cultural morning visit at Musée de Cluny\, located in the heart o
 f the Latin Quarter. Nearly as old as Paris this place has served as Roman
  baths\, as an abbey\, as a palace and even as storage for the city’s sc
 ulptures. Nowadays Cluny is a national museum specialised in medieval hist
 ory. We invite you to discover its temporary exhibition where you will dis
 cover the real history of Nicolas Flamel\, a figure that has inspired our 
 literature and pop culture. After the visit we’ll enjoy lunch and a drin
 k in a restaurant nearby! The event will take place on November 28th. We w
 ill meet at 10:30 at 28 Rue du Sommerard. The event is free for UE citizen
 s between 16-25 years old ????We recommend the other visitors who don’t 
 have their free entry to buy their ticket in advance at the official websi
 te: https://billetterie.musee-moyenage.fr/fr/collection-permanente\n\nhttp
 s://www.billetweb.fr/visit-musee-de-cluny
END:VEVENT
